SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Tunisia vs Résistance Armée Tunisienne
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Tunisia and
  Résistance Armée Tunisienne over control of the government\, starting 1
 980-01-28. This episode was active in 1 year (1980–1980)\, below war lev
 el (25–999 battle deaths a year)\, and ended 1980-01-28.\n\nConflict: Tu
 nisia\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/343\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
