UID:cc218073643b73d9@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800228
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800229
SUMMARY:1980 Andalusian autonomy initiative referendum (Spain)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the initiative of the Andalusian autonomy proce
 ss was held in Andalusia on Thursday\, 28 February 1980. Voters were asked
  whether they ratified a proposed initiative for the provinces of Almería
 \, Cádiz\, Córdoba\, Granada\, Huelva\, Jaén\, Málaga and Seville to o
 rganize themselves into an autonomous community of Spain throughout the le
 gal…\n\nReferendum: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_An
 dalusian_autonomy_initiative_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, 
 via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Andalusian_autonomy_initiative_refer
 endum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
