DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800303
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800304
SUMMARY:Pierre Trudeau takes power (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:Joseph Philippe Pierre Yves Elliott Trudeau was a Canadian poli
 tician\, lawyer\, jurist\, academic\, author\, and journalist who served a
 s the 15th prime minister of Canada from 1968 to 1979 and from 1980 to 198
 4. He served as the leader of the Opposition from 1979 to 1980.\n\nNew lea
 der: Canada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_Trudeau\nText: W
 ikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierre_Trudeau
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
