DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800323
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800324
SUMMARY:1980 Polish parliamentary election (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Poland on 23 March 1980. T
 he results\, like with the other elections in communist Poland\, were cont
 rolled by the communist government. The results of the 1980 election exact
 ly duplicated the 1976 elections\, which were only marginally different fr
 om those of the preceding years.\n\nElection: Poland\nSource: https://en.w
 ikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Polish_parliamentary_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Polish_parliamentary_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
