UID:8bad6962d4d1a852@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800323
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800324
SUMMARY:1980 Swedish nuclear power referendum (Sweden)
DESCRIPTION:A non-binding referendum on nuclear power was held in Sweden on
  23 March 1980. Three proposals were put to voters. The second option\, th
 e gradual phasing out of nuclear power\, won a narrow plurality of the vot
 e\, receiving 39.1% of the ballots cast to 38.7% for option 3. Option 1 wa
 s the least popular\, receiving only 18.9% of the votes.\n\nReferendum: Sw
 eden\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Swedish_nuclear_power_ref
 erendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.page
 s.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Swedish_nuclear_power_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
