SUMMARY:1980 Honduran Constituent Assembly election (Honduras)
DESCRIPTION:Constituent Assembly elections were held in Honduras on 20 Apri
 l 1980. In July the Assembly elected Policarpo Paz García as president.\n
 \nElection: Honduras\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Honduran_
