DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800501
SUMMARY:Inauguration of Beatrix (Netherlands)
DESCRIPTION:The inauguration of Beatrix as Queen of the Netherlands took pl
 ace on 30 April 1980 at the Nieuwe Kerk in Amsterdam. Beatrix ascended the
  throne immediately following the abdication of her mother Juliana earlier
  that day.\n\nInauguration: Netherlands\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/
 wiki/Inauguration_of_Beatrix\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvi
 an Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Inauguration
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inauguration_of_Beatrix
