DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800502
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800503
SUMMARY:1980 Nepalese governmental system referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the system of government was held in Nepal on 2
  May 1980. Voters were offered the choice between a non-partisan panchayat
  system and a multi-party system. The panchayat system received a slim maj
 ority of 54.99%\, whereas Multi-Party System only received 45.2% of the to
 tal votes. Voter turnout was 66.9%.\n\nReferendum: Nepal\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Nepalese_governmental_system_referendum\nText: 
 Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Nepalese_governmental_system_referen
 dum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
