DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800505
SUMMARY:Lazar Koliševski takes power (Yugoslavia / Serbia)
DESCRIPTION:Lazar Koliševski was a Macedonian Yugoslav communist political
  leader in the Socialist Republic of Macedonia and briefly in the Socialis
 t Federal Republic of Yugoslavia. He was closely allied with Josip Broz Ti
 to.\n\nNew leader: Yugoslavia / Serbia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
 iki/Lazar_Koli%C5%A1evski\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian 
 Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
