SUMMARY:1980 Greek presidential election (Greece)
DESCRIPTION:An indirect election for the position of President of the Helle
 nic Republic was held by the Hellenic Parliament in April–May 1980.\n\nE
 lection: Greece\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Greek_presiden
 tial_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
