SUMMARY:George Rallis takes power (Greece)
DESCRIPTION:Georgios Ioannou Rallis\, anglicised to George Rallis\, was a G
 reek conservative politician and Prime Minister of Greece from 1980 to 198
 1.\n\nNew leader: Greece\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Ral
 lis\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.de
