DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800516
SUMMARY:Cvijetin Mijatović takes power (Yugoslavia / Serbia)
DESCRIPTION:Cvijetin "Majo" Mijatović was a Yugoslav communist politician 
 who served as President of the Presidency of Yugoslavia from 1980 to 1981.
  He also served as President of the League of Communists of Bosnia and Her
 zegovina from 1965 to 1969.\n\nNew leader: Yugoslavia / Serbia\nSource: ht
 tps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cvijetin_Mijatovi%C4%87\nText: Wikipedia (CC B
 Y-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
