DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800518
SUMMARY:Coup d'état of May Seventeenth (South Korea)
DESCRIPTION:The Coup d'état of May Seventeenth was a military coup d'état
  staged by General Chun Doo-hwan on 17 May 1980 against the civilian gover
 nment of President Choi Kyu-hah in South Korea.\n\nCoup: South Korea\nSour
 ce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coup_d%27%C3%A9tat_of_May_Seventeenth\nT
 ext: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
