DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800520
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800521
SUMMARY:1980 Quebec referendum (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:The 1980 Quebec independence referendum was the first referendu
 m in Quebec on the place of Quebec within Canada and whether Quebec should
  pursue a path toward sovereignty. The referendum was called by Quebec's P
 arti Québécois (PQ) government\, which advocated secession from Canada.\
 n\nReferendum: Canada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Quebec_r
 eferendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pa
 ges.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Quebec_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
