DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800523
SUMMARY:1980 Czechoslovak presidential election (Czechoslovakia)
DESCRIPTION:The 1980 Czechoslovak presidential election was carried out on 
 22 May 1980 by the deputies of the two houses of the nation's parliament\,
  the Federal Assembly\, rather than by popular vote. Gustáv Husák was re
 -elected for his second term.\n\nElection: Czechoslovakia\nSource: https:/
 /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Czechoslovak_presidential_election\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
