SUMMARY:1980 vote of no confidence in the government of Adolfo Suárez (Spa
 in)
DESCRIPTION:A motion of no confidence in the Spanish government of Adolfo S
 uárez was debated and voted in the Congress of Deputies between 28 and 30
  May 1980. It was brought by Spanish Socialist Workers' Party (PSOE) leade
 r Felipe González.\n\nParliament vote: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/1980_vote_of_no_confidence_in_the_government_of_Adolfo_Su%C3%A1
 rez\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.de
 v).
