 pia (backed by Government of Cuba) and Government of Somalia over control 
 of Ogaden\, starting 1980-05-31. This episode was active in 1 year (1980
 –1980)\, below war level (25–999 battle deaths a year)\, and ended 198
 0-12-03.\n\nConflict: Ethiopia\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/268\nT
