SUMMARY:1980 Icelandic presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Iceland on 29 June 1980. Th
 e result was a victory for Vigdís Finnbogadóttir\, who received 34% of t
 he vote. She became the world's first democratically elected female presid
 ent.\n\nElection: Iceland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1980_Icel
 andic_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvia
 n Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
