DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800913
SUMMARY:Coup: 1980 Turkish coup d'état (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:The 1980 Turkish coup d'état\, headed by Chief of the General 
 Staff General Kenan Evren\, was the third coup d'état in the history of t
 he Republic of Turkey\, the previous having been the 1960 coup and the 197
 1 coup by memorandum.\n\nCoup: Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/1980_Turkish_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via V
 itruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
