DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800921
SUMMARY:Kenan Evren takes power (irregular seizure of power) (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:Ahmet Kenan Evren was a Turkish military officer who served as 
 the 7th president of Turkey from 1982 to 1989. He assumed the post by lead
 ing the 1980 military coup.\n\nCoup: Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/Kenan_Evren\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manag
 er (jdpi.pages.dev).
