DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800922
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800923
SUMMARY:Battle of Khorramshahr (1980) (Iran)
DESCRIPTION:The First Battle of Khorramshahr was a major battle in the Iran
 –Iraq War\, beginning shortly after the Iraqi invasion of Iran in Septem
 ber 1980. Amidst the gruelling urban warfare in and around the city\, Khor
 ramshahr came to be referred to by the Iranians as Khuninshahr\, as both s
 ides had suffered heavy casualties in combat.\n\nConflict: Iran\nSource: h
 ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Khorramshahr_(1980)\nText: Wikipedi
 a (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Khorramshahr_(1980)
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
