DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19800922
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19800923
SUMMARY:Iraq invades Iran\, starting the Iran–Iraq War
DESCRIPTION:The Iran–Iraq War\, also called the First Imposed War\, Eight
 -Year War\, or Sacred Defense by Iran\, began with the Iraqi invasion of I
 ran in September 1980. After eight years of conflict\, both countries acce
 pted a ceasefire deal brokered by the United Nations\, which became effect
 ive in August 1988.\n\nConflict: Iran\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/Iran%E2%80%93Iraq_War\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian M
 anager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iran%E2%80%93Iraq_War
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
