SUMMARY:Edward Seaga takes power (Jamaica)
DESCRIPTION:Edward Philip George Seaga was a Jamaican politician and record
  producer. He was the fifth Prime Minister of Jamaica\, from 1980 to 1989\
 , and the leader of the Jamaica Labour Party from 1974 to 2005. He served 
 as Leader of the Opposition from 1974 to 1980\, and again from 1989 until 
 January 2005.\n\nNew leader: Jamaica\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
