 er 4\, 1980. The Republican ticket of former California governor Ronald Re
 agan and former director of central intelligence George H. W. Bush defeate
 d the Democratic ticket of incumbent president Jimmy Carter and vice presi
 dent Walter Mondale\, and the Independent ticket of Congressman John B.\n\
