SUMMARY:José Napoleón Duarte takes power (irregular seizure of power) (El
  Salvador)
DESCRIPTION:José Napoleón Duarte Fuentes was a Salvadoran politician who 
 served as the 36th President of El Salvador from 1984 to 1989 during the S
 alvadoran Civil War. He was mayor of San Salvador before running for presi
 dent in 1972. He lost\, but the election is widely viewed as fraudulent.\n
