SUMMARY:1981 Liechtenstein constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Liechtenstein on 10 May
  1981. Voters were asked whether they approved of amending article 46\, wh
 ich covered the number of seats in the Landtag\, its membership and the el
 ectoral system. The proposal\, which had been narrowly rejected in a 1975 
 referendum\, was rejected by 52.9% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Liechtenstein
 \nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1981_Liechtenstein_constitutional_
 referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.p
 ages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1981_Liechtenstein_constitutional_referen
 dum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
