SUMMARY:Assassination of Ziaur Rahman (Bangladesh)
DESCRIPTION:Ziaur Rahman\, the sixth president of Bangladesh\, was assassin
 ated by members of the Bangladesh Army on 30 May 1981 in the southeastern 
 port city of Chittagong. Rahman went to Chittagong to arbitrate in a clash
  between the local leaders of his political party\, the Bangladesh Nationa
 list Party (BNP).\n\nAssassination: Bangladesh\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ziaur_Rahman\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\
 , via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
