DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19810605
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19810606
SUMMARY:Pandemic: Epidemiology of HIV/AIDS
DESCRIPTION:The global pandemic of HIV/AIDS began in 1981\, and is an ongoi
 ng worldwide public health issue. According to the World Health Organizati
 on (WHO)\, by 2023\, HIV/AIDS had killed approximately 40.4 million people
 \, and approximately 39 million people were infected with HIV globally. Of
  these\, 29.8 million people (75%) are receiving antiretroviral treatment.
 \n\nCrisis: International\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epidemiol
 ogy_of_HIV/AIDS\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (j
 dpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epidemiology_of_HIV/AIDS
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
