DESCRIPTION:Garret Desmond FitzGerald was an Irish Fine Gael politician\, e
 conomist\, and barrister who served twice as Taoiseach\, serving from 1981
  to 1982 and 1982 to 1987. He served as Leader of Fine Gael from 1977 to 1
 987 and was twice Leader of the Opposition between 1977 and 1982\; he was 
 previously Minister for Foreign Affairs from 1973 to 1977.\n\nNew leader: 
 Ireland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garret_FitzGerald\nText: Wi
