DESCRIPTION:In the first Gulf of Sidra incident\, 19 August 1981\, two Liby
 an Sukhoi Su-22M3 Fitter-G fired upon two U.S. Grumman F-14A Tomcats and w
 ere subsequently shot down off the Libyan coast.\n\nConflict: Libya\nSourc
