SUMMARY:Mauno Koivisto takes power (Finland)
DESCRIPTION:Mauno Henrik Koivisto was a Finnish politician who served as th
 e president of Finland from 1982 to 1994. He also served as the country's 
 prime minister twice\, from 1968 to 1970 and again from 1979 to 1982. He w
 as also the first member of the Social Democratic Party to be elected as P
 resident of Finland.\n\nNew leader: Finland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/Mauno_Koivisto\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Ma
 nager (jdpi.pages.dev).
