SUMMARY:Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting 1981 (Australia)
DESCRIPTION:The 1981 Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting was the sixth
  Meeting of the Heads of Government of the Commonwealth of Nations. It was
  held in Melbourne\, Victoria\, between 30 September 1981 and 7 October 19
 81\, and was hosted by Australian Prime Minister Malcolm Fraser.\n\nSummit
 : Australia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commonwealth_Heads_of_G
 overnment_Meeting_1981\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Man
