DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19811006
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19811007
SUMMARY:Assassination of Anwar Sadat (Egypt)
DESCRIPTION:On 6 October 1981\, Anwar Sadat\, the 3rd president of Egypt\, 
 was assassinated during the annual victory parade held in Cairo to celebra
 te the victory over Israel in the Yom Kippur War. The assassination was un
 dertaken by members of the Egyptian Islamic Jihad.\n\nAssassination: Egypt
 \nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Anwar_Sadat\nText
 : Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
