DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19811013
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19811014
SUMMARY:1981 Egyptian presidential confirmation referendum
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Egypt on 13 October 1981 fo
 llowing the assassination of President Anwar Sadat on 6 October. House of 
 Representatives speaker Sufi Abu Taleb became acting president until the n
 ew president was elected. The vote took the form of a referendum on the ca
 ndidacy of vice president and interim prime minister Hosni Mubarak.\n\nRef
 erendum: Egypt\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1981_Egyptian_presid
 ential_confirmation_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitru
 vian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
