DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19811014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19811015
SUMMARY:Kåre Willoch takes power (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:Kåre Isaachsen Willoch was a Norwegian politician who served a
 s the prime minister of Norway from 1981 to 1986 and as leader of the Cons
 ervative Party from 1970 to 1974. He previously served as the minister of 
 trade and shipping from August to September 1963 and 1965 to 1970\, and as
  the president of the Nordic Council in 1973.\n\nNew leader: Norway\nSourc
 e: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%A5re_Willoch\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
 -SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
