DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19811019
SUMMARY:Wojciech Jaruzelski takes power (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:Wojciech Witold Jaruzelski was a Polish military general\, poli
 tician and de facto leader of the Polish People's Republic from 1981 until
  1989\, serving as a military dictator from 13 December 1981 until 22 July
  1983.\n\nNew leader: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wojcie
 ch_Jaruzelski\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdp
 i.pages.dev).
