DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19811022
SUMMARY:Andreas Papandreou takes power (Greece)
DESCRIPTION:Andreas Georgiou Papandreou was a Greek academic and economist 
 who was prime minister of Greece from 1981 to 1989 and again from 1993 to 
 1996. He founded PASOK\, the Panhellenic Socialist Movement.\n\nNew leader
 : Greece\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andreas_Papandreou\nText: 
