SUMMARY:Battle of Khorramshahr (1982) (Iran)
DESCRIPTION:The Second Battle of Khorramshahr\, also known in Iran as the L
 iberation of Khorramshahr was the Iranian recapture of the city of Khorram
 shahr on 24 May 1982\, during the Iran–Iraq War. The city had been captu
 red by the Iraqis earlier in the war\, on 26 October 1980\, shortly after 
 the Iraqi invasion of Iran.\n\nConflict: Iran\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/Battle_of_Khorramshahr_(1982)\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\,
  via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
