SUMMARY:1982 visit by Pope John Paul II to the United Kingdom
DESCRIPTION:The visit of Pope John Paul II to the United Kingdom in 1982 wa
 s the first visit there by a reigning pope. The Pope arrived in the UK on 
 Friday 28 May\, and during his time there visited nine cities\, delivering
  16 major addresses.\n\nSummit: United Kingdom\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/1982_visit_by_Pope_John_Paul_II_to_the_United_Kingdom\nText: W
