DESCRIPTION:The assassination of Erkut Akbay refers to the murder of the Tu
 rkish administrative attache\, Erkut Akbay\, 40\, in Lisbon\, where the di
 plomat was serving\, on 7 June 1982. Akbay was assassinated near his home 
 on the outskirts of the city as he returned home for lunch with his wife.\
