DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in the Bahamas on 10 June 1982. The
  result was a victory for the Progressive Liberal Party\, which won 32 of 
 the 43 seats. Janet Bostwick of the Free National Movement (FNM) became th
 e first female member of the House of Assembly.\n\nElection: Bahamas\nSour
