DESCRIPTION:The 1982 Bonn summit was the 6th NATO summit bringing the leade
 rs of member nations together at the same time. The formal sessions and in
 formal meetings in Bonn took place on 10 June 1982. This event was only th
 e seventh meeting of the NATO heads of state following the ceremonial sign
 ing of the North Atlantic Treaty on 4 April 1949.\n\nSummit: West Germany\
 nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1982_Bonn_NATO_summit\nText: Wikipe
