DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19820705
SUMMARY:Jacobo Majluta Azar takes power (Dominican Republic)
DESCRIPTION:Jacobo Majluta Azar was 47th president of the Dominican Republi
 c for a month in 1982. He was previously the 32nd vice president under Pre
 sident Antonio Guzmán Fernández from 1978 until his accession to the pre
 sidency. Following Fernández's death in July 1982\, Majluta completed his
  term and handed over power to Salvador Jorge Blanco the following month.\
 n\nNew leader: Dominican Republic\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/J
 acobo_Majluta_Azar\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager
