DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19820704
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19820705
SUMMARY:1982 Mexican general election (Mexico)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Mexico on 4 July 1982. The presi
 dential elections were won by Miguel de la Madrid\, who received 74% of th
 e vote. In the Chamber of Deputies election\, the Institutional Revolution
 ary Party (PRI) won 299 of the 372 seats\, as well as winning 63 of the 64
  seats in the Senate election.\n\nElection: Mexico\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/1982_Mexican_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
