SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Hyde Park and Regent's Park bombings (United King
 dom)
DESCRIPTION:The Hyde Park and Regent's Park bombings were carried out on 20
  July 1982 in London\, England. Members of the Provisional Irish Republica
 n Army (IRA) detonated two improvised explosive devices during British mil
 itary ceremonies in Hyde Park and Regent's Park\, both in central London.\
 n\nCrisis: United Kingdom\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyde_Park
 _and_Regent%27s_Park_bombings\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruv
