SUMMARY:1982 Dutch general election (Netherlands)
DESCRIPTION:Early general elections were held in the Netherlands on 8 Septe
 mber 1982. The Labour Party emerged as the largest party\, winning 47 of t
 he 150 seats in the House of Representatives\; however\, this would be the
  last time it did so until 1994.\n\nElection: Netherlands\nSource: https:/
 /en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1982_Dutch_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
 -SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
