SUMMARY:Poul Schlüter takes power (Denmark)
DESCRIPTION:Poul Holmskov Schlüter was a Danish politician who served as P
 rime Minister of Denmark from 1982 to 1993. He was the first member of the
  Conservative People's Party to become prime minister\, as well as the fir
 st conservative to hold the office since 1901. Schlüter was a member of t
 he Folketing for the Conservative People's Party from 1964 to 1994.\n\nNew
  leader: Denmark\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poul_Schl%C3%BCter
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
