SUMMARY:Assassination of Bachir Gemayel (Lebanon)
DESCRIPTION:On 14 September 1982\, a bomb was detonated during a meeting of
  the right-wing Kataeb Party in the Beirut neighbourhood of Achrafieh. Mil
 itia commander and Lebanese president-elect Bashir Gemayel and 23 other Ka
 taeb Party politicians were killed in the attack.\n\nAssassination: Lebano
 n\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Bachir_Gemayel\n
