SUMMARY:Nellie massacre (India)
DESCRIPTION:The Nellie massacre took place in central Assam during a seven-
 hour period on the morning of 18 February 1983. The massacre claimed the l
 ives of 2000–3000 people from 14 villages—Alisingha\, Khulapathar\, Ba
 sundhari\, Bugduba Beel\, Bugduba Habi\, Borjola\, Butuni\, Dongabori\, In
 durmari\, Mati Parbat\, Muladhari\, Mati Parbat no.\n\nProtest: India\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nellie_massacre\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
