SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 1983 US embassy bombing in Beirut (Lebanon)
DESCRIPTION:The April 18\, 1983\, United States Embassy bombing was a suici
 de bombing on the Embassy of the United States in Beirut\, Lebanon\, that 
 killed 32 Lebanese\, 17 Americans\, and 14 visitors and passers-by. The vi
 ctims were mostly embassy and CIA staff members\, but also included severa
 l US soldiers and one U.S. Marine Security Guard.\n\nCrisis: Lebanon\nSour
 ce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1983_US_embassy_bombing_in_Beirut\nText:
