DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19830627
SUMMARY:1983 Italian general election (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:The 1983 Italian general election was held in Italy on 26 June 
 1983. The Pentapartito formula\, the governative alliance between five cen
 trist parties\, caused unexpected problems to Christian Democracy. The all
 iance was fixed and universal\, extended both to the national government a
 nd to the local administrations.\n\nElection: Italy\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/1983_Italian_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
