DESCRIPTION:The 1983 Turkish embassy attack was an attack on the Turkish em
 bassy in Lisbon on 27 July 1983\, which resulted in the death of 7 people\
 , including all 5 attackers.\n\nCrisis: Portugal\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/1983_Turkish_embassy_attack_in_Lisbon\nText: Wikipedia (CC B
 Y-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
