 d OLF over control of Oromiya\, starting 1983-07-31. This episode was acti
 ve in 10 years (1983–1992)\, below war level (25–999 battle deaths a y
 ear)\, and ended 1992-06-30.\n\nConflict: Ethiopia\nSource: https://ucdp.u
