DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19830805
SUMMARY:Bettino Craxi takes power (Italy)
DESCRIPTION:Benedetto "Bettino" Craxi was an Italian politician and statesm
 an\, leader of the Italian Socialist Party (PSI) from 1976 to 1993\, and t
 he 45th prime minister of Italy from 1983 to 1987. He was the first PSI me
 mber to become prime minister and the second from a socialist party to hol
 d the office.\n\nNew leader: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
 Bettino_Craxi\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdp
