DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19830804
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19830805
SUMMARY:Coup: 1983 Upper Voltan coup d'état (Republic of Upper Volta)
DESCRIPTION:On 4 August 1983\, a coup d'état was launched in the Republic 
 of Upper Volta in an event sometimes referred to as the August revolution 
 or Burkinabé revolution. It was carried out by radical elements of the ar
 my led by Thomas Sankara and Blaise Compaoré\, against the regime of Majo
 r Jean-Baptiste Ouédraogo.\n\nCoup: Republic of Upper Volta\nSource: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1983_Upper_Voltan_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
