DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19830815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19830816
SUMMARY:Manuel Noriega takes power (irregular seizure of power) (Panama)
DESCRIPTION:Manuel Antonio Noriega Moreno was a Panamanian military officer
  and dictator who was the de facto ruler of Panama from 1983 to 1989. He n
 ever officially served as president of Panama\, instead ruling as an unele
 cted military dictator through puppet presidents.\n\nCoup: Panama\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuel_Noriega\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
 .0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
