DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19830822
SUMMARY:Assassination of Ninoy Aquino (Philippines)
DESCRIPTION:On August 21\, 1983\, on the apron of what was then Manila Inte
 rnational Airport\, Benigno "Ninoy" Aquino Jr.\, a former Philippine senat
 or\, was assassinated with a gunshot to the head.\n\nAssassination: Philip
 pines\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ninoy_Aquino
