DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19831009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19831010
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Rangoon bombing (Myanmar)
DESCRIPTION:The Rangoon bombing of 9 October 1983 was an assassination atte
 mpt orchestrated by North Korea against Chun Doo-hwan\, the fifth presiden
 t of South Korea\, in Rangoon\, Burma. Although Chun survived\, 21 people 
 died in the attack and 46 were injured.\n\nCrisis: Myanmar\nSource: https:
 //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rangoon_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, 
 via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
