DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19840702
SUMMARY:1984 Liechtenstein women's suffrage referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the introduction of women's suffrage in nationa
 l elections was held in Liechtenstein on 1 July 1984. Following the introd
 uction of female suffrage in neighbouring Switzerland at the federal level
  after a referendum in 1971\, Liechtenstein had been the only remaining Eu
 ropean country to deny women the right to vote.\n\nReferendum: Liechtenste
 in\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_Liechtenstein_women%27s_suf
 frage_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (
 jdpi.pages.dev).
