DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Saint Kitts and Nevis on 25 July
  1984. The result was a victory for the People's Action Movement (PAM)\, w
 hich won six of the eleven directly-elected seats. The ruling coalition of
  PAM and the Nevis Reformation Party continued as a result of the election
 s.\n\nElection: Saint Kitts and Nevis\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
