SUMMARY:1984 Canadian federal election (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:The 1984 Canadian federal election was held on September 4\, 19
 84\, to elect members to the House of Commons of the 33rd Parliament of Ca
 nada\, following the dissolution of the House on July 9. The Progressive C
 onservative Party\, led by Brian Mulroney\, won a landslide victory\, defe
 ating the incumbent governing Liberal Party led by Prime Minister John Tur
 ner.\n\nElection: Canada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_Canad
 ian_federal_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manag
 er (jdpi.pages.dev).
