DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19840915
SUMMARY:Shimon Peres takes power (Israel)
DESCRIPTION:Shimon Peres was an Israeli politician and statesman who served
  as the prime minister of Israel from 1984 to 1986 and from 1995 to 1996 a
 nd as the president of Israel from 2007 to 2014. He was a member of twelve
  cabinets and represented five political parties in a political career spa
 nning 70 years.\n\nNew leader: Israel\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wi
 ki/Shimon_Peres\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (j
 dpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
