DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19840918
SUMMARY:Brian Mulroney takes power (Canada)
DESCRIPTION:Martin Brian Mulroney was a Canadian lawyer\, businessman\, and
  politician who served as the 18th prime minister of Canada from 1984 to 1
 993. He led the Progressive Conservative Party of Canada and served as a m
 ember of Parliament (MP) from 1983 to 1993.\n\nNew leader: Canada\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brian_Mulroney\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
 .0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
