UID:534aa3849d28726a@jdpi.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19841104
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19841105
SUMMARY:1984 Nicaraguan general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Nicaragua on 4 November 1984\, t
 o elect a president and parliament. Approximately 1.2 million Nicaraguans 
 voted\, representing a 75% turnout\, with 94% of eligible voters registere
 d. Three of the opposition parties in Nicaragua boycotted the election.\n\
 nElection: Nicaragua\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_Nicaragua
 n_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager
  (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_Nicaraguan_general_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
