DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19841106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19841107
SUMMARY:1984 United States presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in the United States on Novemb
 er 6\, 1984. Incumbent Republican president Ronald Reagan and his running 
 mate\, incumbent vice president George H. W. Bush\, were re-elected to a s
 econd term\; they defeated the Democratic ticket of former vice president 
 Walter Mondale and New York congresswoman Geraldine Ferraro in a landslide
 .\n\nElection: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_U
 nited_States_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via V
 itruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
