DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19841126
SUMMARY:1984 Argentine Beagle conflict dispute resolution referendum (Argen
 tina)
DESCRIPTION:A non-binding referendum on resolving the Beagle conflict was h
 eld in Argentina on 25 November 1984. Voters were asked whether they appro
 ved of the government's negotiated settlement with Chile\, which would res
 ult in Argentina recognising the Picton\, Lennox and Nueva islands as bein
 g Chilean territory.\n\nReferendum: Argentina\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/1984_Argentine_Beagle_conflict_dispute_resolution_referendum\nT
 ext: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
