DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19841204
SUMMARY:1984 Grenadian general election (Grenada)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Grenada on 3 December 1984\, the
  first after the U.S.-led invasion that followed two coups. The result was
  a victory for the New National Party\, which won 14 of the 15 seats. Vote
 r turnout was 86%.\n\nElection: Grenada\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/
 wiki/1984_Grenadian_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
  Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
