DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19841210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19841211
SUMMARY:Treaty signed: United Nations Convention Against Torture
DESCRIPTION:The Convention Against Torture and Other Cruel\, Inhuman or Deg
 rading Treatment or Punishment is an international human rights treaty und
 er the review of the United Nations that aims to prevent torture and other
  acts of cruel\, inhuman\, or degrading treatment or punishment around the
  world.\n\nTreaty: International\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Un
