SUMMARY:1985 Norwegian parliamentary election (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Norway on 8 and 9 Septembe
 r 1985. The Labour Party remained the largest party in the Storting\, winn
 ing 71 of the 157 seats. It was the first election since 1885 in which the
  Liberal Party failed to win a seat.\n\nElection: Norway\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1985_Norwegian_parliamentary_election\nText: Wikiped
