DESCRIPTION:Legislative elections were held in Mexico on 7 July 1985. The I
 nstitutional Revolutionary Party won 292 of the 400 seats in the Chamber o
 f Deputies. Voter turnout was 51–52%.\n\nElection: Mexico\nSource: https
