DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19850711
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Sinking of the Rainbow Warrior (New Zealand)
DESCRIPTION:The sinking of Rainbow Warrior\, codenamed Opération Satanique
 \, was an act of French state-terrorism carried out on 10 July 1985. The e
 vent was described by France as a "covert operation" by the "action" branc
 h of the French foreign intelligence agency\, the Directorate-General for 
 External Security (DGSE).\n\nCrisis: New Zealand\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Sinking_of_the_Rainbow_Warrior\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
 0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
