DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19850920
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 1985 Mexico City earthquake
DESCRIPTION:The 1985 Mexico City earthquake struck in the early morning of 
 19 September at 07:17:50 (CST) with a moment magnitude of 8.0 and a maxima
 l Mercalli intensity of IX (Violent). The event caused serious damage to t
 he Greater Mexico City area and the deaths of at least 5\,000 people.\n\nC
 risis: Mexico\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1985_Mexico_City_eart
 hquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages
 .dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1985_Mexico_City_earthquake
