DESCRIPTION:The 1985 Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting was the eight
 h Meeting of the Heads of Government of the Commonwealth of Nations. It wa
 s held in Nassau\, the Bahamas\, between 16 and 22 October 1985\, and was 
