SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Palace of Justice siege (Colombia)
DESCRIPTION:The Palace of Justice siege was an attack carried out in Bogot
 á\, Colombia\, on November 6–7\, 1985\, in which a guerrilla commando o
 f the 19th of April Movement (M-19) took over the Palace of Justice\, hous
 ing the Supreme Court and the Council of State.\n\nCrisis: Colombia\nSourc
 e: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Justice_siege\nText: Wikipedia 
