DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19860115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19860116
SUMMARY:Coup: 1986 Lesotho coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:The 1986 Lesotho coup d'état was a military coup that took pla
 ce in Lesotho on 20 January 1986\, led by General Justin Lekhanya. It led 
 to the deposition of Prime Minister Leabua Jonathan\, who held the office 
 since 1965 and assumed dictatorial powers in the 1970 coup d'état\, after
  the general election was annulled.\n\nCoup: Lesotho\nSource: https://en.w
 ikipedia.org/wiki/1986_Lesotho_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-
 SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Coup
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1986_Lesotho_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat
