DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:19860116
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19860117
SUMMARY:1986 Algerian National Charter referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the enrichment of the National Charter was held
  in Algeria on 16 January 1986. The changes were approved by 98% of voters
  with a turnout of 98%.\n\nReferendum: Algeria\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/1986_Algerian_National_Charter_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC
