SUMMARY:1986 Liechtenstein general election
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Liechtenstein on 31 January and 
 2 February 1986. The result was a victory for the Patriotic Union\, which 
 won 8 of the 15 seats in the Landtag. The Progressive Citizens' Party won 
 seven seats\, whilst the new Free List was less than 1% short of the 8% el
 ectoral threshold and failed to win a seat. Voter turnout was 93.3%.\n\nEl
 ection: Liechtenstein\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1986_Liechten
 stein_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Man
