SUMMARY:Battle: First Battle of al-Faw (Iraq)
DESCRIPTION:The First Battle of al-Faw was a battle of the Iran–Iraq War\
 , fought on the al-Faw peninsula between 10 February and 10 March 1986. Th
 e Iranian operation is considered to be one of Iran's greatest achievement
 s in the Iran–Iraq War.\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/First_Battle_of_al-Faw\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitr
