SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Somalia vs SNM
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Somalia and
  SNM over control of the government\, starting 1986-03-03. This episode wa
 s active in 11 years (1986–1996)\, 4 of them at war level (1\,000+ battl
 e deaths a year)\, and ended 1996-12-20.\n\nConflict: Somalia\nSource: htt
 ps://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/337\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvi
