DESCRIPTION:Legislative elections were held in France on 16 March 1986 to e
 lect the eighth National Assembly of the Fifth Republic. Because of the 47
 th of the 110 Propositions for France\, this election was conducted under 
 a system of party-list proportional representation\, unlike other legislat
 ive elections of the Fifth Republic.\n\nElection: France\nSource: https://
