DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19860427
SUMMARY:Chernobyl nuclear disaster (Soviet Union)
DESCRIPTION:On 26 April 1986\, reactor 4 of the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Pla
 nt\, located near Pripyat in the Ukrainian SSR of the Soviet Union\, explo
 ded. The accident resulted in dozens of direct deaths and a major release 
 of radioactive material into the environment\, causing widespread health e
 ffects and requiring the establishment of the Chernobyl exclusion zone.\n\
 nCrisis: Soviet Union\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chernobyl_dis
 aster\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.
