SUMMARY:Gro Harlem Brundtland takes power (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:Gro Brundtland\, known as Gro Harlem Brundtland\, is a Norwegia
 n stateswoman and former physician\, who thrice served as the Prime Minist
 er of Norway\, and as the leader of the Labour Party from 1981 to 1992\, a
 nd as the director-general of the World Health Organization from 1998 to 2
 003.\n\nNew leader: Norway\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gro_Harl
