SUMMARY:Sinan Hasani takes power (Yugoslavia / Serbia)
DESCRIPTION:Sinan Hasani was a Yugoslav novelist\, statesman\, diplomat and
  a former President of the Presidency of Yugoslavia\, a revolving form of 
 executive leadership which rendered him the President of Yugoslavia at the
  time as well. He was of Albanian ethnicity.\n\nNew leader: Yugoslavia / S
 erbia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinan_Hasani\nText: Wikipedia
