SUMMARY:Ruling: Murder of the Faruqis (United States)
DESCRIPTION:The murder of the Faruqis occurred on May 27\, 1986\, at their 
 home in Wyncote\, Pennsylvania\, United States. Isma'il Raji al-Faruqi\, a
  prominent Islamic scholar\, and his wife\, Lois Lamya al-Faruqi\, a respe
 cted art historian known for her contributions to ethnomusicology\, were k
 illed in an attack that drew widespread attention due to their academic st
 anding…\n\nCourt ruling: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/Murder_of_the_Faruqis\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvia
 n Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
