DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19860530
SUMMARY:Errol Barrow takes power (Barbados)
DESCRIPTION:Errol Walton Barrow was a Barbadian statesman and the first pri
 me minister of Barbados. Born into a family of political and civic activis
 ts in the parish of Saint Lucy\, he became a WWII aviator\, combat veteran
 \, lawyer\, politician\, gourmet cook and author. He is often referred to 
 as the "Father of Independence" in Barbados.\n\nNew leader: Barbados\nSour
 ce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Errol_Barrow\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 
