 in Ecuador on 2 June 1986 alongside provincial elections. The proposal was
  rejected by 69% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Ecuador\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/1986_Ecuadorian_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)
 \, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
