DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19860609
SUMMARY:1986 Bulgarian parliamentary election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Bulgaria on 8 June 1986. T
 he Fatherland Front\, dominated by the Bulgarian Communist Party\, was the
  only organization to contest the election\; all candidate lists had to be
