  election was the first Italian election in which the distance between the
  Christian Democrats and the Communists grew significantly instead of decr
 easing. Two parties that had not previously been in parliament won represe
 ntation: the Greens with thirteen seats\, and the Northern League with two
 .\n\nElection: Italy\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1987_Italian_g
