DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the National Charter was held in Niger on 16 Ju
 ne 1987. In the first national vote since the military coup in 1974\, vote
 rs were asked whether they approved of the Charter\, which would establish
  non-elective\, consultative institutions at both national and local level
 s. It was approved by 99.58% of voters with a 96.8% turnout.\n\nReferendum
 : Niger\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1987_Nigerien_National_Char
 ter_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jd
