SUMMARY:Battle: Operation Earnest Will (United Arab Emirates)
DESCRIPTION:Operation Earnest Will was an American military protection of K
 uwaiti-owned tankers from Iranian attacks in 1987 and 1988\, three years i
 nto the Tanker War phase of the Iran–Iraq War. It was the largest naval 
 convoy operation since World War II\, and flowed from Resolution 598 which
  had been adopted three days earlier.\n\nConflict: United Arab Emirates\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Earnest_Will\nText: Wikiped
 ia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Conflict
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Earnest_Will
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
