DESCRIPTION:An independence referendum was held in New Caledonia on 13 Sept
 ember 1987. Voters were given the choice of remaining part of France or be
 coming independent. The referendum was boycotted by independence movements
 . Only 1.7% voted in favour of independence.\n\nReferendum: France\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1987_New_Caledonian_independence_referendu
