DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19870914
SUMMARY:1987 Liechtenstein double yes referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the "double yes" for referendums was held in Li
 echtenstein on 13 September 1987. The proposal would mean that during refe
 rendums on draft legislation\, voters would have the option of rejecting a
 ll proposals\, agreeing with one proposal\, or agreeing to several.\n\nRef
 erendum: Liechtenstein\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1987_Liechte
 nstein_double_yes_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvi
