SUMMARY:Coup: 1987 Burkina Faso coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:The 1987 Burkina Faso coup d'état was a violent military coup 
 in Burkina Faso\, which took place on 15 October 1987. The coup was organi
 zed by Captain Blaise Compaoré against incumbent far-left President Capta
 in Thomas Sankara\, his former friend\, bandmate\, and associate during th
 e 1983 upheaval.\n\nCoup: Burkina Faso\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
 iki/1987_Burkina_Faso_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\,
