DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Haiti on 29 November 1987\, with
  a second round planned for 29 December. Voters were to elect the Presiden
 t\, 77 deputies and 27 senators. However\, the elections were suspended du
 e to a massacre of voters.\n\nElection: Haiti\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/1987_Haitian_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\,
