SUMMARY:1989 Salvadoran presidential election (El Salvador)
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in El Salvador on 19 March 198
 9. The result was a victory for Alfredo Cristiani of the ARENA party\, who
  secured a majority in the first round. The election marked the first time
  in Salvadoran history that power was transferred from one democratically 
 elected president to another. Voter turnout was 54.7%.\n\nElection: El Sal
 vador\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1989_Salvadoran_presidential_
