SUMMARY:1989 Uruguayan amnesty referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on an amnesty law was held in Uruguay on 16 April 
 1989. The amnesty had prevented the prosecution of the military and police
  who had been responsible for murder\, torture and disappearances during t
 he civic-military dictatorship between 1973 and 1985. The law was retained
  with 56% in favour of it.\n\nReferendum: Uruguay\nSource: https://en.wiki
 pedia.org/wiki/1989_Uruguayan_amnesty_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-S
