 dreds of Meskhetian Turks were killed or injured\, around 1\,000 propertie
 s were destroyed\, and tens of thousands of Meskhetian Turks fled to other
  Soviet republics.\n\nProtest: Soviet Union\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
