DTEND;VALUE=DATE:19890720
SUMMARY:1989 Polish presidential election (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:Indirect presidential elections were held in Poland on 19 July 
 1989. The elections were the first after the office of President of the Re
 public of Poland had been re-established after a period of Communist rule 
 and were the last in which the President was elected by Parliament. Despit
 e adoption of the democratic system there was only one candidate.\n\nElect
 ion: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1989_Polish_presidentia
 l_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi.p
 ages.dev).
