DESCRIPTION:Jan Peder Syse was a Norwegian lawyer and politician from the C
 onservative Party. He was the prime minister of Norway from 1989 to 1990. 
 He also served as the minister of Industry from 1983 to 1985. Syse was the
  president of the Lagting from 1993 to 1997. Syse was the president of the
  Nordic Council in 1988 and 1993.\n\nNew leader: Norway\nSource: https://e
