DESCRIPTION:Egon Rudi Ernst Krenz is a German former politician who was the
  last Communist leader of the German Democratic Republic during the Revolu
 tions of 1989. He succeeded Erich Honecker as the General Secretary of the
  ruling Socialist Unity Party of Germany (SED) but was forced to resign on
 ly weeks later when the Berlin Wall fell.\n\nNew leader: East Germany\nSou
 rce: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egon_Krenz\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
