DESCRIPTION:The 1989 Commonwealth Heads of Government Meeting was the 11th 
 Meeting of the Heads of Government of the Commonwealth of Nations. It was 
 held in Kuala Lumpur\, Malaysia\, between 18–24 October 1989\, and was h
 osted by Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad.\n\nSummit: Malaysia\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commonwealth_Heads_of_Government_Meet
