DESCRIPTION:A general election was held in Spain on 29 October 1989 to elec
 t the members of the 4th Cortes Generales under the Spanish Constitution o
 f 1978. All 350 seats in the Congress of Deputies were up for election\, a
 s well as 208 of 254 seats in the Senate.\n\nElection: Spain\nSource: http
