 hoose the country's eighth president\, to succeed Kenan Evren. The candida
 te of the governing Motherland Party (ANAP) was its leader and Prime Minis
 ter Turgut Özal. In the first and second rounds\, the ruling party ANAP w
 as unsuccessful in electing its candidate.\n\nElection: Turkey\nSource: ht
