DESCRIPTION:The Fall of the Berlin Wall and the fortified inner German bord
 er occurred immediately... without delay after a Politburo press conferenc
 e on 9 November 1989 prematurely announced that East Germans could travel 
 without restrictions after\, in the decades before\, hundreds had been kil
 led by Border Troops of the German Democratic Republic when trying to snea
 k…\n\nCrisis: Germany\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fall_of_the
 _Berlin_Wall\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via Vitruvian Manager (jdpi
